      "message": "I\u0027m a bit concerned about changing the behaviour of the file operator, as it\u0027s being used in many submit requirements and people may rely on the current behaviour.\n\nWe did have a similar issue with the has:submodule-update operator (see [1]). For this operator we added a \"base\" parameter [2]. Instead of changing the behaviour of the file operator could we do the same here and support \"file:...,base\u003d...\"? Otherwise that would be inconsistent.\n\n[1] https://gerrit-review.git.corp.google.com/c/gerrit/+/349216\n\n[2] https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/Documentation/config-submit-requirements.html#operator_has_submodule_update",
